<description>&lt;p&gt;Violent gangs are seizing thousands of homes in Mexico City while a mayor who fought cartels was assassinated, prompting riots and roadblocks in Matamoros after his son was detained. Truck drivers halted protests demanding action on highway crime, then resumed after dialogue with the government. A Mexican engineer and another man were indicted for building cross-border drug tunnels, with the latter charged with terrorism. Federal agents arrested Sinaloa Cartel members in Tennessee and targeted a drug-smuggling operation on the Texas Gulf Coast. 37 battle-related deaths in 1996, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMizgFBVV95cUxQVzVreDNxcmwxUFdVUWNuMjBzSTNrQTRTUl93TFpUOFc5VmpEUHJZOG9OdThHZVd6U1phSmRhNVRHVFBTSGx6TkRoQUdXbU9oUzZ5TXlPSTRHTFlqWHlPQ19RdXRaeC1OOE5lZkdEWEJlSnI3UEppM01pcHBBM185dzhSbnZUSjJMVlU3aWVSVDB4cjRwQWVzSmFDQTNDZjZvbXNSNWRXZGFfNm9PRE5HNHFhVVl1TWtXMlFOaHRmU1FQSXVLZkFUQVU2alFUQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Los Angeles Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxPNEhWVDdDNHV4YnVhZURGOTd2bEN2OVVuUUdlMlMybDIxako0NmRHYmZTWVFaOGZjRFdHNXpkbWZsSUJOUW52cHdaVFZGUnZKd0p1NnJwM1EzcDFScldpS21oSjVvaG9VYjR1SkM0LWVxbVZqd3lkY21yeEEtUUhjME9HOTNfSGlwa2t4VUR2Q0FkOXFvX1BFX25qZGI3NDdPc1VN?oc=5&quot;&gt;FreightWaves&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMijgFBVV95cUxOdG8tQ29PajVQbXRXLTlJa3Y5aUpLTnZ5cGZodU1sRm1Ea1FmSlpJZGx0Vl9adHJYaUNLb2d6dkJQWWcyc1l4UGxOVHF3cXZCeUl2eDVTWnFHY1ZzR09nc1BQTEFyNFlxUGdZV0hheHdyUEM2b0o5MW1rSnBueGNObkRTQ3F6aGMzWHQ3Q1NR?oc=5&quot;&gt;CBS News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiugFBVV95cUxNZk9XNWZxRU9ZUmxIdERfNmhnY1VmcTNPQ25rNHJZZ2U0dmVKWnM4RU55TDRqY01TenNwdk0zS2hyVVE2Q2NNTjcwdk5mMXRzLXdoMUJ6